file: macros/src/forwarding.rs
breaks: A method over an enum whose every variant is under `#[cfg]`, in a partial or inherent block, writes no warning in the build that leaves no variant, as `docs/what-is-generated.md` promises nothing a careful hand would not write.
expect: killed

find:
        (self.may_be_empty && !self.arguments.is_empty())
replace:
        (self.may_be_empty && self.arguments.is_empty())
